    "detailed_description": "<h1>Wishlist the full version of Last Soul</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425580/extras/03840dd65eabf83f29a058b96b417a35.avif?t=1660719076\" /></div><br><br>Our Kickstarter preregistration page is now live. Preregister now so you don't miss out when Kickstarter goes live sometime soon. You won't want to miss out all the cool early-bird perks.<br><br><strong>Last Soul</strong> is a 2d pixel art action platformer with a compelling story about a future where mankind has lost its will.<br><br>Welcome to <strong>LAST SOUL</strong>. Play like BOP, the only hero that humanity has in this wonderful sci-fi story. Learn to survive by shooting your way out of evils enemies and bosses ready to consume you.<br><br>Join our  community of amazing gamers, developers, and artists that suggest ideas for our game while having fun playing new updates.<br><br><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Play as an AI robot tasked with saving humanity.  <br></li><li>Explore and fight your way through 4 distinct regions, each with a variety of levels<br></li><li>Evolve your character through 3 stages of progression, unlocking new and more powerful weapons and abilities.<br></li><li>Master a suite of powers, including bullet time, jet pack, and shields.<br></li><li>Take on awesome boss enemies, or die trying.</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425580/extras/6a603833f7bb2772b9cd968c1e3f44dd.poster.avif?t=1660719076\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425580/extras/6a603833f7bb2772b9cd968c1e3f44dd.webm?t=1660719076\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1425580/extras/6a603833f7bb2772b9cd968c1e3f44dd.mp4?t=1660719076\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">GET YOURSELF ON THE LOOP OF THIS CREATION</h2><br>Join our Newsletter and get access to demos and free codes of our game before release day. You'll be able to play our Player-Test by registering your email.",
